      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WRONGLY ACCUSED (4) jumped from box 1 last time and ran away with an impressive win scoring by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 29.00. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Can measure up again. JUNGLE JOHNNY (7) goes very well this trip starting 45 times for 22 wins and 11 minors. Missed the frame latest (29.82) when sixth over 515m at this track in a Special conditions race. Can feature with the right run. PAW WINDER (1) continues to race in super honest form, hitting the frame two times on end before scoring an overdue win last time out (29.47) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. CORBAN YAXLEY (2) was a last-start winner at big odds and can measure up again.",
